{"meta":{"id":"assembly-api","category":"it/tools/api","title":"국회 API 사용","subtitle":"","summary":"열린국회정보 API 호출 예시","tags":["api","국회","open api","react"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"blog: etc/AssemblyApI.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-06-04"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>API</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-06-04</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">국회 API 사용</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 열린국회정보 API 호출 예시</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 space-y-1.5\">\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">그냥 국민입법참여 센터에서 보는게 속 편합니다.</p>\r\n<p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><a href=\"https://opinion.lawmaking.go.kr/gcom/nsmLmSts/out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-teal-700 font-semibold underline underline-offset-2\">국민참여입법센터 링크</a></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">API 호출 (본회의 처리안건_법률안)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">import axios from &#x27;axios&#x27;;\r\n\r\nconst API_KEY = process.env.REACT_APP_ASSEMBLY_API_KEY;\r\nconst BASE_URL = &#x27;https://open.assembly.go.kr/portal/openapi/nwbpacrgavhjryiph&#x27;;\r\n\r\nconst fetchData = async (billName) =&gt; {\r\n  const params = {\r\n    KEY: API_KEY,\r\n    Type: &#x27;json&#x27;,\r\n    Age: &#x27;21&#x27;,          // 국회 대수\r\n    BILL_NM: billName,  // 법안명 검색어\r\n  };\r\n  const response = await axios.get(BASE_URL, { params });\r\n  return response.data?.nwbpacrgavhjryiph?.[1]?.row || [];\r\n};</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">API 키는 열린국회정보 포털에서 발급받아 .env 에 넣어 사용합니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">결과 표시 항목</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">필드</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>BILL_NO</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">번호</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>BILL_NM</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">내용 (법안명)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>PROC_RESULT_CD</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">결과</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>PROPOSE_DT</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">날짜 (제안일)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/tools/api/assembly-api","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"tools","title":"기타 작업물","path":"it/tools"},{"id":"api","title":"API · 라이브러리 활용","path":"it/tools/api"}],"hasImage":false}